  "<b>Faisla</b>: Is form me edge kharche aur out-of-sample ke baad nahi bachta (baseline OOS -Rs 691,258, 2x slippage pe OOS return -47% of capital). Fixed size par poora loss -Rs 1,465,122 = capital ka -147% - yaani account Rs 1,000,000 se zyada kha leta (live me size ghatana padta). Warning: sector map static hai, data spot hai (futures nahi), stock list survivorship se bacha hai par lot size 2024 se pehle estimated hai."
